================================================================================
SCOPE LOCK RULES (what NOT to touch)
================================================================================

  ✗ NO globals.css changes
  ✗ NO homepage component changes
  ✗ NO data structure / schema changes
  ✗ NO Sanity query changes
  ✗ NO store mutations or state logic changes (covered by BASKET_DATA_INTEGRITY_SPRINT)
  ✗ NO builds during development — dev server for verification
  ✗ NO lg: breakpoint classes — MUST use lg-desktop: and lg-touch: per lesson
  ✗ NO raw Tailwind colors (bg-black, text-white, text-gray-*, hover:text-red-*)
  ✗ NO raw Tailwind typography (text-lg, font-bold, font-black outside type-* tokens)
  ✗ NO improvements outside scope contracts

================================================================================
BREAKPOINT CONSTRAINT (from tailwind-breakpoint-shadowing lesson)
================================================================================

  CRITICAL: This codebase has custom breakpoints that shadow defaults.
  
  BANNED breakpoints: lg:
  REQUIRED breakpoints: lg-desktop: and lg-touch:
  
  Files requiring lg: → lg-desktop:/lg-touch: conversion:
    - app/(store)/basket/BasketClientWrapper.tsx (lg:grid-cols-3, lg:col-span-2, lg:col-span-1)
    - app/(store)/basket/Basket.tsx (lg:grid, lg:grid-cols-[...], lg:flex, lg:items-center, lg:justify-center, lg:hidden)
    - app/(store)/basket/BasketSummary.tsx (if any)
  
  Reference pattern (from ProductGrid.tsx):
    grid-cols-1 xs:grid-cols-2 lg-desktop:grid-cols-3 lg-touch:grid-cols-2

