SC1: QuantitySelector Shared Component — [DG-11]
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

  Gap Coverage: DG-11 (Quantity controls differ between PDP and basket)

  Target State:
    New shared component at app/components/ui/QuantitySelector.tsx
    Used identically on PDP (size="md") and basket page (size="sm")
    btn-secondary token for ± buttons
    type-body text-primary for quantity display
    aria-label on buttons, role="status" aria-live="polite" on quantity

  ASCII Layout:
    size="sm" (basket):  [−] [2] [+]   w-8 h-8 buttons, w-8 quantity, gap-1
    size="md" (PDP):     [ − ] [ 2 ] [ + ]   w-10 h-10 buttons, w-12 quantity, gap-2

  Props Interface:
    quantity: number
    min?: number (default 1)
    max: number (stock limit)
    onIncrement: () => void
    onDecrement: () => void
    size?: 'sm' | 'md' (default 'md')

  Files:
    CREATE: app/components/ui/QuantitySelector.tsx

