SC8: Item Removal Animation + Accessibility — [DG-09, DG-17]
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

  Gap Coverage:
    DG-09: No item removal animation (items vanish instantly)
    DG-17: Missing accessibility attributes on interactive elements

  Target State:
    Removal: Row fades out (opacity 0, 200ms) then collapses (max-h-0, 300ms)
    Accessibility: aria-live regions, descriptive aria-labels, keyboard nav

  Animation Spec:
    1. User clicks remove → row gets opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200
    2. After 200ms → row gets max-h-0 overflow-hidden transition-[max-height] duration-300
    3. After 500ms total → removeItem() called on store

  Accessibility Spec:
    QuantitySelector: aria-label on ± buttons, quantity role="status" aria-live="polite"
    Remove button: aria-label="Remove {product.name} from basket"
    Summary total: wrap in aria-live="polite" region
    Skeleton: aria-busy="true" (handled in SC7)

  Files:
    MODIFY: app/components/features/basket/BasketControls.tsx (removal animation trigger)
    MODIFY: app/(store)/basket/Basket.tsx (row animation classes)
    MODIFY: app/components/ui/QuantitySelector.tsx (if a11y not already done in SC1)
    MODIFY: app/(store)/basket/BasketSummary.tsx (aria-live on total)

  DoD:
    ☐ Item removal: fade-out + collapse animation before store removal
    ☐ Remove button: aria-label="Remove {product.name} from basket"
    ☐ QuantitySelector quantity: role="status" aria-live="polite"
    ☐ BasketSummary total: aria-live="polite" region
    ☐ All interactive elements keyboard-focusable with visible focus indicators

  Delegation:
    /implement "Add removal animation and accessibility per SC8 in BASKET_DESIGN_SPRINT.todo"

  Verification:
    Dev server: Remove item → smooth fade + collapse → item gone
    Manual check: Tab through basket — all controls focusable, focus rings visible

