EXECUTION SEQUENCE
================================================================================

  Phase A — Foundation (parallel, ~30 min):
    1. /implement SC1 (QuantitySelector)
    2. /implement SC2 (Price standardization)
       → Verify: Both components render correctly on dev server

  Phase B — Controls (parallel after A, ~45 min):
    3. /implement SC3 (BasketControls rewrite)
    4. /implement SC4 (PDP quantity + feedback)
       → Verify: Basket controls and PDP controls visually identical, feedback works

  Phase C — Page Components (~45 min):
    5. /implement SC5 (Basket item list + breakpoints)
    6. /implement SC6 (Basket summary)
    7. /implement SC7 (Loading & empty states + breakpoints)
       → Verify: Full basket page renders correctly at desktop and mobile widths

  Phase D — Polish (~20 min):
    8. /implement SC8 (Removal animation + accessibility)
       → Verify: Smooth removal, keyboard navigation works

  Final:
    → Visual check: Full user journey (PDP add → basket view → quantity change → remove → empty state)
    → Grep audit: Zero lg: classes, zero bg-gray-*, zero bg-black/text-white in basket files

